  "about": {
    "body": {
      "status": "confirmed",
      "value": "I like games where the rules are the level. My flagship project, A Course In Time, is a puzzle-platformer about one building across time — so most of what I've built is the machinery underneath: the switch between eras, the generators that make puzzles, the save system that remembers them, and the tools that let other people test them."
    },
